{"id":1590,"slug":"gomorrah","title":"Gomorrah","year":2008,"country":"Italy","duration":137,"spine":493,"url":"https://www.criterion.com/films/1590-gomorrah","cover":"https://s3.amazonaws.com/criterion-production/films/d44e5fe193d826c1402ee5f1298f6b80/zSEPmdinwC1ua22Jrvrq3yZ5ZhYrxa_large.jpg","description":"Matteo Garrone’s Gomorrah is a stark, shocking vision of contemporary gangsterdom, and one of cinema’s most authentic depictions of organized crime. In this tour de force adaptation of undercover Italian reporter Roberto Saviano’s best-selling exposé of Naples’ Mafia underworld (known as the Camorra), Garrone links five disparate tales in which men and children are caught up in a corrupt system that extends from the housing projects to the world of haute couture. Filmed with an exquisite detachment interrupted by bursts of violence, Gomorrah is a shattering, socially engaged true-crime story from a major new voice in Italian cinema.","boxset":0,"scraped":1,"directors":[{"name":"Matteo Garrone","slug":"matteo-garrone"}],"cast":[{"actor":"Toni Servillo","role":"Franco","slug":"toni-servillo"},{"actor":"Salvatore Abruzzese","role":"Toto","slug":"salvatore-abruzzese"},{"actor":"Gianfelice Imparato","role":"Don Ciro","slug":"gianfelice-imparato"},{"actor":"Maria Nazionale","role":"Maria","slug":"maria-nazionale"},{"actor":"Salvatore Cantalupo","role":"Pasquale","slug":"salvatore-cantalupo"},{"actor":"Gigio Morra","role":"Iavarone","slug":"gigio-morra"},{"actor":"Marco Macor","role":"Marco","slug":"marco-macor"}],"credits":[{"role":"Director","person":"Matteo Garrone","slug":"matteo-garrone"},{"role":"Producer","person":"Domenico Procacci","slug":null},{"role":"Screenplay","person":"Maurizio Braucci","slug":null},{"role":"Screenplay","person":"Ugo Chiti","slug":null},{"role":"Screenplay","person":"Gianni Di Gregorio","slug":null},{"role":"Screenplay","person":"Matteo Garrone","slug":"matteo-garrone"},{"role":"Screenplay","person":"Massimo Gaudioso","slug":null},{"role